\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-270\li270\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1\cf0 .   The Lord God is our Great Father
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 Our life is in His hands
\par He gives our mind and soul all care;
\par And calls us to His side
\par Comforter of our soul.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.   If God created us this way
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 Let us heed to His call,
\par and let us give Him all the praise
\par and be with  Him always
\par and patiently we be.
\par 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  Our Lord and Savior Jesus Christ
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0   from His heaven came down
\par  He came to suffer for our sins
\par  a heavy pain He bore;
\par  He died to save us all
\par 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  If Jesus is such a Saviour
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0  Let's give our thanks to Him,
\par  and let us love Him from our hearts
\par   and let us be mindful
\par \pard   that we may all be saved!\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

